Source: pg-turbovec
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), cargo, clang, git, rustc
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://codeberg.org/gregburd/pg_turbovec

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-turbovec
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pg-turbovec
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: TurboQuant-compressed vector search for PostgreSQL PGVERSION
 pg_turbovec provides compressed vector types and a PostgreSQL index access
 method backed by the TurboQuant quantizer. It supports exact and approximate
 nearest-neighbor search with L2, inner-product, cosine, and L1 distances.
